{
  "_readme": [
    "JSON-LD for האופה - בוטיק לחם. Draft 2026-10-24 by the SEO step. Every value below comes from research.json (verify:branches and research:*) or the owner's own accounts; sources are in _sources.",
    "Placeholder origin https://haofe.example must be replaced everywhere before deploy (.example is reserved, so a missed one is obvious).",
    "pages: paste each page's jsonld object into that page as <script type=\"application/ld+json\"> ... </script>, rendered in the HTML on the server (not injected by client JS).",
    "pending_owner_confirmation: values that exist but are not confirmed, or are MISSING. Merge only after confirmation.",
    "No ordering markup: on 24.10.2026 the owner removed the ordering app from the site, so no node carries an order action or a menu link to it, and the app's domain must not appear in any built page, sitemap or JSON-LD. Ordering is by phone only (Organization.contactPoint, contactType orders, 1700-55-22-55).",
    "Not marked up on purpose: Beit Shemesh (closed / unknown), the production plant at הסוללים 1 (not a customer location, last confirmed 2023), aggregateRating/review (self-serving reviews are not eligible), priceRange (no prices published), servesCuisine.",
    "If a JS framework serializes this, escape every < as \\u003c."
  ],
